{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52793","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 张绰","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北阙皇恩重，东门紫气飞。\n爲看宾客去，何似买臣归。\n迎绶旋江国，题舆入侍闱。\n千年旧迹在，七日故人非。\n别涕沾霓服，离筵着锦衣。\n无因伴仙羽，空此羡光辉。\n（同前）（按：《全唐诗》卷八六一收仙人张辞诗四首，《桂苑丛谈》、《增修诗话总龟前集》卷四句均作张绰，惟《太平庆记》卷七五引作张辞，疑应作「张绰」爲是。\n仙人张绰传爲咸通初人，与本诗作者时代不合，爲另一人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张绰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}